@startuml UC-13
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-13.md
title UC-13: View Categories
footer Feature CAT-01 | Business rules: BR-10, BR-13
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "CategoriesController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "CategoryService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open category menu
MVC -> API : GET /api/categories
API -> SVC : GetTreeAsync()
SVC -> DB : Select categories WHERE IsActive = 1\nORDER BY SortOrder (BR-10)
DB --> SVC : Categories
SVC -> SVC : Build parent/child tree (BR-13)
SVC --> API : CategoryTreeDto[]
API --> MVC : 200 OK
MVC --> U : Show category tree

@enduml
